1
00:00:19,144 --> 00:00:21,188
Are you sure it's this way, Keiji?

2
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:24,274
Don't underestimate my nose,
Elizabeth.

3
00:00:24,816 --> 00:00:27,361
There's also a scent of
another animal mixed in...

4
00:00:27,903 --> 00:00:29,905
If we mess up,
Piyoko might already be...!

5
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:35,577
Help me... Mister!

6
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:39,581
EPISODE 4
HOMING IN ON DESIRE

7
00:00:39,915 --> 00:00:45,712
Let me go! Let me go!
Let me go!

8
00:00:54,054 --> 00:00:55,514
Hold it, cat burglar!

9
00:00:56,098 --> 00:00:59,017
Give us that chick back, calmly.

10
00:00:59,601 --> 00:01:01,603
M-Mister!

11
00:01:01,979 --> 00:01:03,397
<i>This is my prey!</i>

12
00:01:03,772 --> 00:01:04,940
<i>I'll never hand it over!</i>

13
00:01:05,732 --> 00:01:08,402
Then a fight it is...

14
00:01:15,909 --> 00:01:17,536
Mama!

15
00:01:17,786 --> 00:01:19,037
Mama...

16
00:01:19,121 --> 00:01:20,831
Mama...

17
00:01:20,914 --> 00:01:22,082
Mama...

18
00:01:22,165 --> 00:01:24,459
I told you not to leave the house!

19
00:01:24,668 --> 00:01:28,839
- We're hungry!
- I'm starving, Mama!

20
00:01:28,922 --> 00:01:31,883
Did you take Piyoko...
for your children?

21
00:01:32,342 --> 00:01:35,053
I haven't been able to give
my children a proper meal

22
00:01:35,137 --> 00:01:36,597
over the last 10 days...

23
00:01:37,097 --> 00:01:40,642
If you'd like...
I have a little bit of food...

24
00:01:40,767 --> 00:01:41,768
What?

25
00:01:47,316 --> 00:01:51,945
It's a nutritious freshly laid egg!
I was just about to lay one.

26
00:01:52,362 --> 00:01:53,697
Wow!

27
00:01:54,031 --> 00:01:55,324
What is this?

28
00:01:55,407 --> 00:01:57,826
- It looks tasty!
- It smells good!

29
00:01:57,951 --> 00:01:59,202
Don't worry, please eat it.

30
00:01:59,494 --> 00:02:01,955
It's an unfertilized egg,
so it's not alive.

31
00:02:02,039 --> 00:02:04,040
- Thank you!
- So delicious!

32
00:02:04,041 --> 00:02:07,502
Well, I'll be able to lay one too,
one of these days.

33
00:02:09,755 --> 00:02:11,840
I don't know how I can thank you!

34
00:02:11,965 --> 00:02:14,217
I can't eat them myself,

35
00:02:14,301 --> 00:02:16,011
so I usually have to
throw them away.

36
00:02:16,428 --> 00:02:18,055
I'm glad it didn't go to waste.

37
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:22,100
But... you're a domesticated cat, right?

38
00:02:22,392 --> 00:02:24,561
Your owner doesn't feed you?

39
00:02:24,978 --> 00:02:26,938
Well... that's...

40
00:02:30,859 --> 00:02:32,361
Hey Elizabeth, look.

41
00:02:34,363 --> 00:02:36,573
W-What are those holes?

42
00:02:37,366 --> 00:02:39,076
Everyone's digging!

43
00:02:39,493 --> 00:02:42,287
Women...
Even the elderly!

44
00:02:42,913 --> 00:02:45,040
They don't seem to be
in their right minds.

45
00:02:46,124 --> 00:02:48,043
That's my owner.

46
00:02:48,126 --> 00:02:49,127
What?

47
00:02:49,211 --> 00:02:50,587
What is going on?!

48
00:02:50,712 --> 00:02:52,756
I-I'm scared!

49
00:02:52,923 --> 00:02:54,383
It's that monster's fault.

50
00:02:55,509 --> 00:02:56,551
"Monster"?

51
00:02:57,427 --> 00:02:59,596
It showed up 10 days ago...

52
00:03:00,013 --> 00:03:01,807
I don't know what it's motives are,

53
00:03:02,057 --> 00:03:05,727
but it's making the villagers
dig holes without sleep or rest.

54
00:03:06,812 --> 00:03:09,106
It's living in a mansion on
the outskirts of the village.

55
00:03:12,025 --> 00:03:14,111
I feel so bad for
the children of the village.

56
00:03:14,861 --> 00:03:19,199
They're confined to a shed.
And they aren't being fed properly.

57
00:03:20,742 --> 00:03:23,328
I'm so sorry this happened.

58
00:03:23,745 --> 00:03:25,330
This isn't your fault, Sei!

59
00:03:25,914 --> 00:03:27,541
But we can't take this anymore.

60
00:03:27,999 --> 00:03:30,544
If this keeps up,
we'll actually die.

61
00:03:31,128 --> 00:03:32,712
We have nothing left to lose.

62
00:03:35,006 --> 00:03:37,676
Listen, we have to push
with all our strength.

63
00:03:37,884 --> 00:03:38,885
Okay.

64
00:03:39,010 --> 00:03:40,095
Ready, set...

65
00:03:43,432 --> 00:03:45,434
There was a noise coming
from over there...

66
00:03:48,687 --> 00:03:51,440
I'll hold this guy here,
get out of here!

67
00:03:51,648 --> 00:03:52,857
B-But...

68
00:03:52,858 --> 00:03:54,860
I'm not leaving you, Sei!

69
00:03:54,985 --> 00:03:57,237
Don't be stupid!
They'll kill you if they catch you!

70
00:03:57,487 --> 00:03:59,739
I'll catch up!
Just go!

71
00:03:59,990 --> 00:04:01,074
Don't move!

72
00:04:09,583 --> 00:04:10,667
Sei...

73
00:04:12,669 --> 00:04:15,714
I'll shoot anyone
who tries to escape!

74
00:04:23,638 --> 00:04:25,015
Oh, how amazing!

75
00:04:25,724 --> 00:04:26,933
Chickens?

76
00:04:29,019 --> 00:04:31,146
PROCESSING INPUT

77
00:04:31,730 --> 00:04:33,773
<i>Those two are just passed out.</i>

78
00:04:33,774 --> 00:04:35,901
<i>I'd appreciate it
if you could tie them up</i>

79
00:04:35,942 --> 00:04:37,611
<i>with rope or something
before they wake up.</i>

80
00:04:37,944 --> 00:04:40,280
What? You're kidding!

81
00:04:40,405 --> 00:04:42,073
What's up with these chickens?

82
00:04:42,616 --> 00:04:43,950
It's using a smartphone...

83
00:04:44,075 --> 00:04:46,620
Amazing,
it's a genius chicken!

84
00:04:47,162 --> 00:04:51,541
What an amazing machine...
it can speak human...

85
00:04:54,002 --> 00:04:55,295
Hurry, Sei!

86
00:04:55,378 --> 00:04:57,547
O-okay...
I'm coming!

87
00:05:00,509 --> 00:05:02,385
Let's go to my house for now!

88
00:05:02,511 --> 00:05:03,553
Okay!

89
00:05:03,637 --> 00:05:05,555
Ms. Cat,
thanks for guiding us!

90
00:05:05,764 --> 00:05:08,683
Not at all, I'm happy to help!

91
00:05:09,017 --> 00:05:11,812
It's hard for us chickens
to see clearly at night.

92
00:05:13,605 --> 00:05:14,981
<i>Have you dealt with them?</i>

93
00:05:15,565 --> 00:05:18,985
Probably...
they were the only guards in town.

94
00:05:19,319 --> 00:05:22,614
<i>Have the police or anyone come
to help you at any point?</i>

95
00:05:23,031 --> 00:05:25,492
I have a feeling the officer
possessed by the monster

96
00:05:25,617 --> 00:05:28,995
did a good job
keeping everything under wraps.

97
00:05:30,121 --> 00:05:33,208
Seems this monster is cunning.

98
00:05:35,585 --> 00:05:36,419
Found it!

99
00:05:37,045 --> 00:05:38,588
CHICKEN MISO RAMEN

100
00:05:41,758 --> 00:05:43,927
It smells so good!

101
00:05:44,135 --> 00:05:45,679
You're amazing, Sei.

102
00:05:45,971 --> 00:05:47,389
I'm kinda surprised...

103
00:05:47,639 --> 00:05:50,684
...that there are chickens
in this world that can talk.

104
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:53,687
- It's done!
- Yay!

105
00:05:53,979 --> 00:05:56,314
- Thanks for the food!
- Thanks for the food!

106
00:05:58,358 --> 00:06:00,151
Wow! So good!

107
00:06:02,696 --> 00:06:04,239
I'm so full!

108
00:06:09,244 --> 00:06:10,912
<i>You're seem like you're
used to cooking.</i>

109
00:06:11,204 --> 00:06:13,456
My mom died when I was little,

110
00:06:13,707 --> 00:06:15,166
so I just happened to
get good at it.

111
00:06:16,418 --> 00:06:17,711
I see...

112
00:06:21,131 --> 00:06:23,049
<i>We're currently on a journey</i>

113
00:06:23,133 --> 00:06:26,595
<i>to defeat the Demons
appearing across Japan.</i>

114
00:06:26,803 --> 00:06:30,348
<i>The monster that appeared here
may be a Demon.</i>

115
00:06:32,517 --> 00:06:35,812
<i>I know it's hard seeing your family
be possessed,</i>

116
00:06:35,896 --> 00:06:39,941
<i>but could you tell us anything
about the monster?</i>

117
00:06:42,861 --> 00:06:45,780
We've been locked up
this entire time,

118
00:06:45,906 --> 00:06:46,907
so we don't know much.

119
00:06:47,449 --> 00:06:48,283
I see...

120
00:06:49,075 --> 00:06:50,368
Hey Keiji,

121
00:06:50,410 --> 00:06:53,913
why don't we go pay a visit
to this monster's mansion tomorrow?

122
00:06:54,414 --> 00:06:57,083
Ask how many horns
this monster has...

123
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:58,501
Does it have four?

124
00:06:59,502 --> 00:07:02,881
<i>Does this monster have any horns?
Does it have four?</i>

125
00:07:03,048 --> 00:07:06,801
Uh, no.
I don't think it had that many,

126
00:07:07,260 --> 00:07:08,803
Then I'll pass.

127
00:07:08,887 --> 00:07:09,929
What did you say?!

128
00:07:10,096 --> 00:07:12,849
I only want to settle things
with that bastard.

129
00:07:13,183 --> 00:07:15,727
I could care less about
Demons that have nothing to do with me.

130
00:07:15,810 --> 00:07:18,229
All these people are suffering!

131
00:07:18,355 --> 00:07:19,773
Don't you feel anything for them?

132
00:07:19,898 --> 00:07:20,899
Nope.

133
00:07:22,901 --> 00:07:25,445
You're horrible!
I misjudged you!

134
00:07:35,038 --> 00:07:38,875
<i>Oh no... this is the worst timing!</i>

135
00:07:41,086 --> 00:07:43,838
<i>He's coming!</i>

136
00:07:45,256 --> 00:07:47,801
Not now, this is not the time!

137
00:07:54,391 --> 00:07:57,894
<i>His Highness has arrived!</i>

138
00:07:58,561 --> 00:08:02,565
<i>The Lord of the Rut has arrived!</i>

139
00:08:04,067 --> 00:08:10,031
<i>This extra potent natural urge
only hits me once or twice a year!</i>

140
00:08:11,700 --> 00:08:12,575
<i>I want to do it.</i>

141
00:08:13,451 --> 00:08:15,078
<i>I can't take it anymore!</i>

142
00:08:16,287 --> 00:08:19,791
<i>I want to do it... I want to do it!!</i>

143
00:08:20,834 --> 00:08:22,836
Pardon me...

144
00:08:23,878 --> 00:08:24,879
What?!

145
00:08:25,004 --> 00:08:27,257
What are you doing, you pervert?!

146
00:08:27,382 --> 00:08:29,801
Elizabeth,
you're the only one who can

147
00:08:29,884 --> 00:08:31,928
calm the call of
The Lord of the Rut!

148
00:08:32,011 --> 00:08:33,263
So, please!

149
00:08:33,346 --> 00:08:36,599
You're not making any sense!
It's just your instincts again!

150
00:08:37,809 --> 00:08:40,145
What are the chickens doing?

151
00:08:40,228 --> 00:08:41,604
You think they're okay?

152
00:08:41,771 --> 00:08:42,939
What is it?

153
00:08:42,981 --> 00:08:44,441
I can't see!

154
00:08:47,193 --> 00:08:48,570
Fine.

155
00:08:48,695 --> 00:08:52,032
If you help me take care
of the Demon tomorrow,

156
00:08:52,157 --> 00:08:55,160
I'll give you
what you want.

157
00:08:55,243 --> 00:08:56,244
Really?!

158
00:08:57,203 --> 00:09:00,957
Wait, but does that mean
I have to wait until tomorrow?

159
00:09:01,791 --> 00:09:02,792
Yes.

160
00:09:13,970 --> 00:09:18,808
O-Okay.
Tomorrow it is then. For sure.

161
00:09:19,434 --> 00:09:23,021
<i>He's that desperate?
So scary!</i>

162
00:09:29,235 --> 00:09:31,696
It's my duty...

163
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:37,702
You're dangerous.
Go sleep in the bathroom.

164
00:09:54,219 --> 00:09:55,220
Sei?!

165
00:09:57,305 --> 00:09:59,265
I couldn't sleep a wink.

166
00:09:59,557 --> 00:10:01,726
Never mind that!
Sei's gone!

167
00:10:02,936 --> 00:10:03,978
What happened?

168
00:10:04,771 --> 00:10:06,731
<i>Do you know where Sei went?</i>

169
00:10:07,107 --> 00:10:09,109
You don't think
he went to go see the monster—

170
00:10:09,234 --> 00:10:10,235
Don't!

171
00:10:11,402 --> 00:10:12,529
<i>What do you mean?</i>

172
00:10:13,446 --> 00:10:14,823
Well, um...

173
00:10:28,086 --> 00:10:29,129
Who's there?

174
00:10:29,921 --> 00:10:31,214
<i>Please tell me...</i>

175
00:10:31,464 --> 00:10:34,092
<i>Why did Sei go to
the monster's mansion?</i>

176
00:10:36,928 --> 00:10:38,304
Um, that monster is...

177
00:10:42,267 --> 00:10:45,145
...Sei's father.

178
00:10:45,895 --> 00:10:47,313
Please help him!

179
00:10:47,564 --> 00:10:50,066
Sei is going to get killed!

180
00:10:53,361 --> 00:10:57,031
Show me where this monster is...

181
00:11:01,369 --> 00:11:04,122
Did you come here
to get eaten, kid?

182
00:11:07,375 --> 00:11:10,086
G-Give me back my dad!

183
00:11:12,463 --> 00:11:14,048
You've got
a neat toy with you.

184
00:11:14,132 --> 00:11:16,134
- Give me back my dad!
- Shut up!

185
00:11:23,683 --> 00:11:25,393
D-Dad!

186
00:11:26,561 --> 00:11:29,939
Dad, I'm begging you!
Please stop this!

187
00:11:30,815 --> 00:11:33,818
Sei, hold on for
just a little bit longer...

188
00:11:34,485 --> 00:11:35,653
just a little bit...

189
00:11:35,737 --> 00:11:37,572
and Dad's dreams will come true.

190
00:11:38,948 --> 00:11:40,658
Go! Go, go!

191
00:11:40,867 --> 00:11:43,786
That's it! Looking good.
Let's go 3-6!

192
00:11:45,413 --> 00:11:49,292
Damn it!
I was so close to winning big!

193
00:11:49,542 --> 00:11:51,669
Dad, you borrowed more money,
didn't you?

194
00:11:51,878 --> 00:11:55,757
Yeah, I did.
But I lost it all at the track.

195
00:11:55,882 --> 00:11:57,133
Are you kidding me?!

196
00:11:57,258 --> 00:11:58,885
That's over 5 million!

197
00:11:58,927 --> 00:12:00,887
Do you even have a plan
to pay all of that back?!

198
00:12:00,929 --> 00:12:03,473
Of course I have a plan, Sei!

199
00:12:03,765 --> 00:12:06,851
I'm having someone introduce me
to an underground casino.

200
00:12:07,227 --> 00:12:11,981
I'm gonna win big there,
pay off all of my debts...

201
00:12:12,106 --> 00:12:13,608
and with the money
I have left over,

202
00:12:13,650 --> 00:12:15,276
I'm gonna start my own business.

203
00:12:15,318 --> 00:12:18,696
Then I'll buy us a mansion
with a pool!

204
00:12:20,406 --> 00:12:23,660
Why don't you stop dreaming
and just get a job?

205
00:12:23,743 --> 00:12:28,831
Idiot! No one gets rich
just working at a regular job!

206
00:12:32,252 --> 00:12:35,129
That brat Sei...
Who does he think he is?

207
00:12:35,672 --> 00:12:38,841
I'm not giving up now.

208
00:12:39,259 --> 00:12:42,637
One day, I'm gonna get money
and make it big.

209
00:12:43,846 --> 00:12:44,847
Oh?

210
00:12:49,811 --> 00:12:51,020
Ow...

211
00:12:52,563 --> 00:12:53,564
What is this?

212
00:12:54,649 --> 00:12:55,817
<i>When I dug it up,</i>

213
00:12:55,984 --> 00:12:59,028
<i>There were some old coins
and a scroll inside.</i>

214
00:12:59,821 --> 00:13:02,365
<i>I studied and decoded
the text myself.</i>

215
00:13:02,991 --> 00:13:03,908
<i>It claimed...</i>

216
00:13:04,367 --> 00:13:05,910
<i>A long time ago,</i>

217
00:13:05,994 --> 00:13:11,541
<i>bandits buried their loot of
10,000 ryo somewhere in this area.</i>

218
00:13:11,916 --> 00:13:14,043
<i>Today, that's worth over
1 billion yen.</i>

219
00:13:14,127 --> 00:13:16,504
God's finally on my side!

220
00:13:16,796 --> 00:13:20,466
I'm gonna be rich!

221
00:13:25,847 --> 00:13:30,518
<i>That's when I started digging like
a man possessed by something.</i>

222
00:13:30,977 --> 00:13:33,271
- You're causing trouble!
- Get a hold of yourself, Dai!

223
00:13:33,313 --> 00:13:34,981
- Stop it!
- Give it a rest!

224
00:13:35,023 --> 00:13:36,441
Don't you feel bad for your kid?!

225
00:13:36,482 --> 00:13:37,942
My buried treasure!

226
00:13:40,278 --> 00:13:42,196
- <i>I dug for a year straight,</i>
- It has to be here!

227
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:44,282
- <i>but I couldn't find any treasure.</i>
- I know it is!

228
00:13:44,365 --> 00:13:46,325
Where's my money?

229
00:13:48,453 --> 00:13:50,621
Dad, please stop!

230
00:13:50,955 --> 00:13:52,999
My, my, my...

231
00:13:53,082 --> 00:13:55,418
My money!!

232
00:14:03,009 --> 00:14:04,052
Dad!

233
00:14:07,180 --> 00:14:08,473
Dad!

234
00:14:13,436 --> 00:14:16,898
Please stop already, Dad.

235
00:14:17,523 --> 00:14:20,818
Sei, you want to
be rich too, right?

236
00:14:21,652 --> 00:14:24,571
If we were rich,
we could leave this village.

237
00:14:24,572 --> 00:14:26,324
You'd get all the toys
and snacks you want—

238
00:14:26,365 --> 00:14:27,784
I don't want any of that!

239
00:14:29,994 --> 00:14:33,331
I just want to live a normal life
with you, Dad.

240
00:14:34,290 --> 00:14:36,209
I don't want a lot of money!

241
00:14:38,336 --> 00:14:39,462
I understand.

242
00:14:40,463 --> 00:14:42,215
Hey monster...
Zip me up.

243
00:14:45,218 --> 00:14:49,972
Hey brat, what the hell
are you talking about?

244
00:14:51,390 --> 00:14:52,809
Money's the answer!

245
00:14:53,643 --> 00:14:55,436
Money is everything!

246
00:14:59,398 --> 00:15:00,900
I want money.

247
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:03,611
I want money.

248
00:15:04,070 --> 00:15:05,988
Money!

249
00:15:06,322 --> 00:15:07,698
Money!

250
00:15:07,824 --> 00:15:10,118
Give me money!

251
00:15:10,618 --> 00:15:14,247
Money... money!

252
00:15:14,705 --> 00:15:17,792
I want money!!

253
00:15:20,461 --> 00:15:22,921
Money!

254
00:15:22,922 --> 00:15:24,715
I was right.
A Demon variant.

255
00:15:24,924 --> 00:15:26,801
But I wasn't expecting a giant.

256
00:15:27,051 --> 00:15:28,052
You guys!

257
00:15:28,636 --> 00:15:30,930
Huh? Chickens?

258
00:15:30,972 --> 00:15:34,142
Hey jerk, is "money"
the only word you know?

259
00:15:34,642 --> 00:15:36,686
It really makes my crown curl!

260
00:15:36,769 --> 00:15:39,772
Livestock challenging me
to a fight?

261
00:15:41,774 --> 00:15:43,734
How fun.

262
00:15:45,820 --> 00:15:47,780
Keiji!
Don't look at that!

263
00:15:56,998 --> 00:15:59,292
I knew it!
That's how the villagers were—!

264
00:15:59,917 --> 00:16:03,921
If you want the buried treasure
so much, dig it up yourself!

265
00:16:03,963 --> 00:16:06,132
Don't make others do
your dirty work, you filth!

266
00:16:06,299 --> 00:16:08,301
Shut up, you annoying fly!

267
00:16:10,553 --> 00:16:13,764
How dare you call a lady a fly!

268
00:16:14,974 --> 00:16:16,893
Money...

269
00:16:16,976 --> 00:16:18,978
Did you just do something?

270
00:16:20,521 --> 00:16:22,231
Guess I need more voltage.

271
00:16:22,481 --> 00:16:24,734
I'm the one you're fighting!

272
00:16:41,125 --> 00:16:45,922
No matter where you attack me from,
I'll devour you.

273
00:16:47,048 --> 00:16:50,676
Although, I'd rather devour money...

274
00:16:51,677 --> 00:16:52,803
I see how it is.

275
00:16:53,179 --> 00:16:56,015
<i>Oh, they're supposed to be
zippers on a wallet.</i>

276
00:16:56,057 --> 00:16:57,516
<i>I finally get it now...</i>

277
00:16:57,642 --> 00:16:58,476
In that case...

278
00:16:59,977 --> 00:17:01,395
Take this!

279
00:17:03,147 --> 00:17:06,567
Kokekokko!

280
00:17:06,609 --> 00:17:07,609
He's fast!

281
00:17:07,610 --> 00:17:08,444
What?!

282
00:17:13,282 --> 00:17:15,117
Nice attack.

283
00:17:15,243 --> 00:17:17,954
But it doesn't do anything
if you can't hit anything.

284
00:17:17,995 --> 00:17:19,664
Money...

285
00:17:20,748 --> 00:17:22,124
This guy's a pain...

286
00:17:22,291 --> 00:17:23,292
Mr. Rooster!

287
00:17:24,669 --> 00:17:26,837
Please!
Don't kill my dad!

288
00:17:30,341 --> 00:17:31,384
That's it!

289
00:17:31,842 --> 00:17:34,512
Keiji, lure the Demon over there.

290
00:17:34,679 --> 00:17:35,680
Got it!

291
00:17:40,142 --> 00:17:41,477
Stop it!

292
00:17:46,357 --> 00:17:48,276
Come back here!

293
00:17:49,151 --> 00:17:51,279
Keiji, stop him here!

294
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:52,363
Got it.

295
00:18:02,373 --> 00:18:04,709
Stay still, you fly!

296
00:18:10,464 --> 00:18:12,508
I'll start by eating you first!

297
00:18:21,100 --> 00:18:22,977
Th-These are...!

298
00:18:23,853 --> 00:18:24,937
No way!

299
00:18:28,816 --> 00:18:30,818
<i>This is the only way
to take down the Demon</i>

300
00:18:30,860 --> 00:18:32,069
<i>without killing Sei's father.</i>

301
00:18:43,289 --> 00:18:45,791
<i>If that wasn't enough,
here's more voltage.</i>

302
00:18:47,335 --> 00:18:50,129
T-T-Treasure!

303
00:18:50,588 --> 00:18:51,964
Your back's wide open!

304
00:18:55,301 --> 00:18:57,261
M-My body...

305
00:18:57,303 --> 00:18:58,846
Keiji, now!

306
00:18:59,597 --> 00:19:00,473
Got it!

307
00:19:02,058 --> 00:19:03,225
Take this!

308
00:19:03,684 --> 00:19:07,688
Kokekokko!

309
00:19:10,066 --> 00:19:13,361
Money!

310
00:19:24,413 --> 00:19:25,414
What?

311
00:19:26,207 --> 00:19:27,833
What am I doing here?

312
00:19:28,125 --> 00:19:30,628
What was I doing?

313
00:19:30,670 --> 00:19:31,796
Digging holes?

314
00:19:33,047 --> 00:19:34,340
Oh, she's awake!

315
00:19:37,301 --> 00:19:41,681
Why does my mouth taste like dirt?

316
00:19:42,139 --> 00:19:44,016
Elizabeth!

317
00:19:47,520 --> 00:19:49,939
<i>If you help me take care of
the Demon...</i>

318
00:19:50,398 --> 00:19:53,484
<i>I'll give you
what you want.</i>

319
00:19:55,986 --> 00:19:57,905
Y-Your promise!

320
00:19:59,031 --> 00:20:00,032
Huh?

321
00:20:00,574 --> 00:20:01,409
What?

322
00:20:01,534 --> 00:20:02,827
Did you forget?

323
00:20:03,744 --> 00:20:06,205
I have a long-standing grudge
against you.

324
00:20:06,539 --> 00:20:09,542
I'm not doing anything with you!

325
00:20:23,222 --> 00:20:24,223
Dad!

326
00:20:24,765 --> 00:20:25,766
Dad!

327
00:20:25,850 --> 00:20:27,268
S-Sei...

328
00:20:32,898 --> 00:20:35,234
H-H-Help me!

329
00:20:35,401 --> 00:20:39,947
I was forced to fight and I didn't
even get anything out of it.

330
00:20:40,197 --> 00:20:42,575
This is all your fault.

331
00:20:42,908 --> 00:20:47,788
Nothing good comes out of leaving
a greedy bastard like you alive.

332
00:20:47,997 --> 00:20:49,039
Die!

333
00:20:58,591 --> 00:21:00,468
Stop!

334
00:21:00,593 --> 00:21:03,846
Don't get in my way, brat!
I'm not gonna hold back!

335
00:21:07,808 --> 00:21:09,351
What are you doing, Keiji?!

336
00:21:09,769 --> 00:21:11,771
Dad!

337
00:21:11,812 --> 00:21:12,813
Keiji!

338
00:21:15,649 --> 00:21:18,319
Sei, get out of here!

339
00:21:19,779 --> 00:21:21,614
If you're gonna do it,
just kill me!

340
00:21:21,697 --> 00:21:22,573
Dad!

341
00:21:24,700 --> 00:21:28,788
I'm trash.
I'm a worthless human.

342
00:21:29,747 --> 00:21:32,082
I've been a burden
to everyone in the village.

343
00:21:32,792 --> 00:21:35,961
It's true,
maybe I do deserve to die.

344
00:21:36,879 --> 00:21:38,339
But please...
Spare Sei.

345
00:21:39,256 --> 00:21:42,301
Please don't kill Sei!

346
00:21:43,177 --> 00:21:46,430
He's my precious, precious son!

347
00:21:47,431 --> 00:21:50,809
Please!
Please don't kill my son!

348
00:21:50,810 --> 00:21:51,894
D-Dad...

349
00:21:51,936 --> 00:21:55,731
Please!
Please, Mr. Rooster!

350
00:21:57,233 --> 00:21:58,776
Please!

351
00:22:06,742 --> 00:22:09,912
<i>I hope you remember this feeling
for as long as you live your life.</i>

352
00:22:11,121 --> 00:22:12,832
<i>Sei, do your best.</i>

353
00:22:12,998 --> 00:22:14,458
O-Okay.

354
00:22:14,917 --> 00:22:16,919
<i>Be well.</i>

355
00:22:22,216 --> 00:22:23,842
Guess I'm the kind of guy

356
00:22:23,843 --> 00:22:25,845
who gets scolded by chickens...

357
00:22:26,345 --> 00:22:28,889
There's no way I'd make it big.

358
00:22:30,349 --> 00:22:32,560
That was kind of impressive.

359
00:22:34,770 --> 00:22:40,484
Well, if he doesn't straighten out
after that, then he's real trash.

360
00:22:40,985 --> 00:22:44,864
Oh?
Maybe you're not as bad, after all.

361
00:22:45,614 --> 00:22:46,657
<i>I got a chance!</i>

362
00:22:47,825 --> 00:22:51,579
Of course.
Love conquers all.

363
00:22:52,204 --> 00:22:55,165
Speaking of...
Elizabeth, I love you.

364
00:22:57,334 --> 00:22:59,753
Who's the real...

365
00:23:02,381 --> 00:23:03,340
...trash here?!

366
00:23:10,306 --> 00:23:11,974
<i>The Lord of the Rut...</i>

367
00:23:12,808 --> 00:23:14,435
<i>...has left.</i>

368
00:23:17,771 --> 00:23:19,315
<i>I might have gone too far.</i>

369
00:23:19,440 --> 00:23:22,318
Mister! Are you all right?!

370
00:23:22,401 --> 00:23:23,944
Please get it together!

371
00:23:24,028 --> 00:23:26,030
Are you all right, Mr. Rooster?

372
00:23:26,113 --> 00:23:27,823
Don't overdo it.

373
00:23:30,159 --> 00:23:32,786
I got some really insane
footage here...

374
00:23:33,746 --> 00:23:36,874
This... is gonna go viral.

375
00:23:49,136 --> 00:23:50,721
I can't take this anymore!

376
00:23:50,804 --> 00:23:53,223
I'm done traveling with you two!

377
00:23:53,849 --> 00:23:56,769
Also, what's a Demon doing
in a place like this?

378
00:23:57,186 --> 00:23:59,897
Next time:
The Motley Flock Scatters

379
00:23:59,939 --> 00:24:02,775
Each and every last one them makes my
crown curl!

380
00:24:03,984 --> 00:24:08,906
FAN ART CONTEST AWARDS

